From 3a508903d47128954d054bf1a322530c871972c6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Reznichenko <info@botshare.ai>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 13:02:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] releases: v2.0.0-rc.1 pins to the reviewed main of each
 repository (2026-11-20)

Moves releases/v2.0.0-rc.1.repos from the 2026-10-19 candidate to the
SHAs of openamrobot-release manifests/v2.0.0-rc.1.repos, whose parity
check compares the two. Adds openamrobot-embodied-ai to the development
and rc.1 manifests (14 entries); the two counting tests follow.
Source pins only, not release acceptance.

Signed-off-by: Alex Reznichenko <info@botshare.ai>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01DZnPEMPDB6f8AohTTfGWkF
